      "en": "General fishing rights (free hook-and-line & ice fishing), the National Fisheries Management Fee (Kalastonhoitomaksu), exemptions, and special rapid permits.",
      "zh": "通用渔业权利（传统手竿与冬钓完全免费）、国家渔业管理费（Kalastonhoitomaksu）、年龄豁免机制与特种激流白水许可证。",
